  "description": "Superb One-Bedroom Apartment in Prime Ranelagh Location\n\n***Emails Only***. MFO The Property Professionals are delighted to present this beautifully positioned one-bedroom apartment to the rental market. Ideally located just minutes from Ranelagh Village, the property offers bright, modern accommodation together with the added benefit of a large private balcony and secure parking.***Emails Only***. The well-proportioned accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, spacious living/dining room with large sliding doors opening onto a generous private balcony, and a modern fully fitted kitchen with quality cabinetry and marble worktops. The double bedroom benefits from fitted wardrobes and direct access to the balcony. A contemporary fully tiled bathroom with power shower completes the accommodation.***Emails Only***\n\n***Emails Only***The apartment is situated within easy walking distance of Ranelagh’s excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, boutique shops and everyday amenities. The Luas is also close by, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre, while Leeson Street, Baggot Street and St. Stephen’s Green are all within easy reach.***Emails Only***. Further benefits include secure designated parking and excellent transport links.This is an excellent opportunity to rent a well-presented apartment in a highly sought-after location, close to the city centre and all that Ranelagh has to offer. Viewing is highly recommended.***Emails Only***",
